Package: dreamchess
Version: 0.3.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libsdl2-2.0-0, libsdl2-image-2.0-0, libsdl2-mixer-2.0-0, libexpat1, libepoxy0, libgl1, libglu1-mesa, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libpulse0, libasound2
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Description: 3D OpenGL chess game
 DreamChess is a 3D chess game with several board sets, from classic
 wooden pieces to flat figurines. It includes the Dreamer engine and
 can also use any XBoard-compatible engine.
